{
  "name": "Empower Eidolon",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn how to spend your own magical reserves to empower your Eidolon's attacks. As a Bonus Action, you can spend a spell slot if you can see your Eidolon within 60 feet of you. For 1 hour, you add 1d8 times the level of the spell slot expended to your Eidolon's damage rolls.</p>",
